          "filename": "Münster, St.-Lamberti-Kirche, Portal \"Wurzel Jesse\", Glaskunstwerk \"L’Or\" -- 2022 -- 1380.jpg",
          "caption": "Glass artwork “L’Or” (René Blättermann, 2022) as a door in the Tree of Jesse portal of the St Lamberti Church in Münster, North Rhine-Westphalia, GermanyThe glass artwork was designed by René Blättermann with theological advice from Almuth Jürgensen. The design was implemented by the Pontifical Court Glass Painting DERIX GLASSTUDIOS in Taunusstein under the direction of Olaf Hanweg. The motif shows around the “divine light” 12 symbols: Temple, Stag, Sprout, Birds, Crown, Menorah, Lamberti, Tamar, Nechushtan, Ajin, Cherubim and Bundle.",
